@startuml
skinparam dpi 150
actor Complainant
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Flask API" as API
participant "NLP Engine" as NLP
participant "Routing Service" as R
database "SQLite DB" as DB
actor Officer
Complainant -> UI : Fill in and submit complaint
UI -> API : POST /submit
API -> DB : Save complainant and complaint
API -> NLP : classify(text)
NLP --> API : subject, urgency, sentiment, confidence
API -> R : route(subject, urgency)
R -> DB : Find officer with fewest open cases
R --> API : officer, due date
API -> DB : Save prediction and assignment
API --> UI : Reference number
UI --> Complainant : Show reference number
API -> Officer : Notification (new case)
Officer -> API : Update status or correct labels
API -> DB : Save update
API --> Officer : Updated case
@enduml
